From 646aa6ec0cda45097b2fb707a01701baa20dfa3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Jelen <jjelen@redhat.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:26:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Verify source signatures with openpgpverify

Replace the direct GnuPG verification with %openpgpverify, which
uses Sequoia sqv, as part of the Fedora 45 Change
https://fedoraproject.org/wiki/Changes/Sequoia_openpgpverify

Refresh 0xD73934B49674CF5CCD9AC2787D80315C5736DE75.gpg from
keyservers/WKD: same certificate(s), with self-signatures our copy was
missing.
Release bumped with a changelog entry.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
